---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the use of Pixelquil browser utilities, technical guides, and web optimization tools."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      Terms of Service
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          By accessing or using Pixelquil, including all associated software tools, web converters, documentation, and technical utilities, you enter into a binding agreement to adhere to these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any portion of these provisions, you must immediately discontinue use of the platform.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. Scope of Service</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil provides online software utilities designed for vector editing, search engine optimization audits, and code minification. All primary computations occur client side inside your web browser. Core utilities are accessible without user registration or paid subscriptions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          When using Pixelquil, you agree to comply with all applicable local and international laws. Specifically, you agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>Process code or assets for which you do not hold appropriate rights or authorization.</li>
          <li>Engage in automated scraping or systematic data extraction without prior consent.</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt server availability, inject malicious code, or bypass system boundaries.</li>
          <li>Repackage or mirror the underlying tool scripts as competing web applications.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. User Content Ownership and Privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You retain complete ownership over any code snippets, vector artwork, or configuration files processed using our utilities. Because computational tasks run locally within your browser context, Pixelquil does not claim ownership, inspect, or retain copies of your uploaded data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Warranty Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          All utilities and documentation on Pixelquil are provided on an as is and as available basis without warranties of any kind. While software routines are tested thoroughly, Pixelquil does not guarantee that output files, code minifications, or SEO checks will be completely error free or suit every deployment environment.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You are expected to audit all generated code independently prior to pushing assets to live server environments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Under no circumstances shall Pixelquil or its operators be held liable for direct, indirect, consequential, or incidental damages resulting from service interruptions, software bugs, lost data, or errors in calculated output. Use of all site utilities remains at your own risk.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">7. Third Party Links and Advertising Disclosures</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil displays advertisements powered by Google AdSense and may utilize third party scripts for communication forms. Third party services operate under independent privacy terms and cookie guidelines. We assume no responsibility for external content or vendor practices.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">8. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The Pixelquil name, site layout, visual graphics, custom branding assets, and educational text content belong exclusively to Pixelquil. Unauthorized duplication or redistribution of site content is strictly prohibited.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">9. Modifications to Platform and Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil reserves the right to adjust, enhance, or remove tools at any time without advance warning. Continued access following updates to these Terms of Service signifies acceptance of the revised provisions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">10. Contact Information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          For inquiries regarding these terms, reach out via email at <a href="mailto:hello@pixelquil.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">hello@pixelquil.com</a> or use the <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-medium">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>